<title>BULGARIA: ONE REPO DEAL STRUCK ON BULGARIA BOURSES.</title>
<headline>ONE REPO DEAL STRUCK ON BULGARIA BOURSES.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Wednesday's 41.28 points as no corporate issues traded on Bulgarian bourses for a fourth day in row, brokers said.</p>
<p>One seven-day repo deal in treasury paper worth of 4.028 million levs was struck on the Sofia Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The paper yields 4.96 percent until repurchase.</p>
<p>Wednesday's repo turnover amounted to 3.620 million levs.</p>
<p>-- Dessislava Popova, Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
